WEBVTT

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:28.840
Daddy! Good morning!

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:41.260
Morning...

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:43.350
Stop!

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.160
That's my next quiz!

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.610
I'm sorry.

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:53.530
Food...

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:28.490
<b>Uniforms and Pot Rice</b>

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:33.570
<b>Everyday is Fun 
6 Types of Side Dish</b>

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:36.570
<b>6 Ground Beef Patties</b>

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.760
<b>6 Ground Beef Patties</b>

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:45.900
Daddy!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.100
Can I watch <i>Magi-Girl?</i>

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:51.420
Indeed. Watch while you eat.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.040
The mini-tomatoes...

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.290
<b></b>

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:17.300
I'm out, huh?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.510
Thank you for the food!

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:30.660
It's the exact same as yesterday.

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:31.890
Daddy!

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.170
What's wrong?

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:37.430
The Pink <i>Magi-Girl</i> outfit is gone!

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.190
Hold on.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:43.450
What is it?

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.200
Our land is in trouble...

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.130
In trouble?

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:48.490
I've got a yellow <i>Magi-Girl</i> T-Shirt.

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:52.560
The yellow Magi-Girl is strong too, isn't she?

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:54.350
I'm glad.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:55.290
Yup!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.760
On Sunday, we'll have a laundry tournament!

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:58.710
Yay!

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:04.900
Daddy, all done!

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.850
So clean! Cute!

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:14.940
Daddy! I can't get my head out!

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:18.020
You have to undo the button first.

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:27.070
Bye!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.840
Good morning!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.030
Good morning to you!

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:40.840
Morning, Tsumugi-chan!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.470
The sitter will be here at 4:00 PM.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.760
Thank you!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.850
So she'll be staying late today, right?

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:47.920
See you later!

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.050
We'll see you later!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.060
Inuzuka-sensei!

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:57.810
You coming to the welcome party tomorrow?

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:01.360
Oh, sorry. I'll have to pass.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.320
Aw, too bad!

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.940
He can't help it.

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:07.410
His daughter's still young, right?

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.620
Bring her, then!

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:10.880
It's at a bar, right?

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.460
Inuzuka-sensei!

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:13.040
Yes?

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.440
Are you eating right?

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.380
You're too thin!

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.010
When I see you,

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:24.120
I feel struck by a sense of duty to feed you!

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:27.410
Momoya-sensei, that's none of your business.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:28.900
Don't worry about me.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.720
I was never a big eater.

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:34.410
Do you cook by yourself?

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:38.690
Well, I tried it once, and it brought out 
an expression of my daughter's face

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:41.010
that I'd never seen before.

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:45.640
Well, even the lunches 
at convenience stores

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:48.840
are taking care not to have 
too many calories.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:50.580
Yeah. It's a big help.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.580
What kind of food does your daughter like?

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:54.840
That's a good question.

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.250
Hamburg steak or meat sauce, maybe?

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.830
Yeah, that's pretty typical.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:05.330
I've got class first period.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.820
He rejected me again.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.390
It's to be expected.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.060
It's still only been six months

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.310
since his wife died.

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:25.350
I'm back.

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:26.990
Welcome back, Dad!

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.500
Thank you for the food.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.670
<b>Flower Viewing Season</b>

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.670
<i>There should be good weather this weekend.</i>

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.740
<i>I'm sure people will be going 
to see the flowers all around Japan.</i>

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:49.940
<i>It will be busy.</i>

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.030
I know about this!

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:54.790
These are called cherry blossoms!

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.910
Yup. I'm impressed.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.590
Have a nice weekend, everyone!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.030
Flower viewing?

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:20.550
I'll go.

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:22.030
Good girl.

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:26.520
So we clean until the long hand 
and the short hand meet at the top.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.940
Can you help? Who can help?

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:51.610
Daddy, put Mr. Galigali into my chest, okay?

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:52.990
Leave it to me.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.330
It's pretty crowded.

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:07.350
You okay?

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:08.210
Yup!

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:15.090
There are a lot of people, huh?

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:17.010
Don't look at the people.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.320
Look at the flowers.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:19.720
Okay!

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:41.360
Daddy, I'm getting down!

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.380
Are you okay?

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:49.910
Tsumugi!

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:51.070
I'm sorry.

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:53.160
Tsumugi, you surprised her, see?

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.810
No.

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:59.510
I'm crying because it's good.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:03.990
Um... it's not because I'm sad 
because I'm alone.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:10.040
This was originally made 
for two people. Not one.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:14.350
My mother was coming, and she canceled...

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:15.920
That means she didn't come!

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:16.700
That's right.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:19.550
And at first, I was mad.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.620
But the lunch was good, 
even when I ate it alone.

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:30.130
I know how she made it...
 and how busy she was.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.680
I started to remember that as I ate it.

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:39.090
And I started crying, for some weird reason.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:41.850
Is it that good?

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.140
It's good.

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:44.680
Is it super good?

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.100
It's super good, yes.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:48.560
This good?

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.970
That good!

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:55.630
I'm sorry.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:56.740
I ate it all—

00:09:58.510 --> 00:09:59.640
By yourself?

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:00.900
By myself.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.610
Um...

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:04.450
Okay.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.160
This is my mother's restaurant.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.080
Please come and have something to eat.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:12.590
Lemme see, Daddy!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:17.970
<b>Restaurant</b>

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:16.720
Restaurant!

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:36.390
Should we buy dinner on the way back?

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.870
More boxed lunches today?

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.470
Want to eat at a restaurant?

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:57.990
Thank you for the food.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.390
Was your boxed lunch good?

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.390
This good?

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:06.410
I see.

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:12.250
Feel better?

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.080
Thank you.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:16.240
I feel better!

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:17.360
Gotcha back!

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:26.250
A meeting ran long. Yes.

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:28.170
I'll be back by 6:30.

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:29.960
If you can just lock the door...

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:30.790
Thank you.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.320
I'm back!

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.790
Sorry I'm late!

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.300
You must be hungry, right?

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:42.780
<i>Yes! If you use the Perfect Pro 
Pressure Cooker, it's so quick and easy!</i>

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:45.180
<i>And look at this meat!</i>

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.480
Meat...

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:49.170
<i>Look at how tender this meat is!</i>

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:50.680
Tender...

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.890
<i>It's so good! It looks like 
it melts in your mouth!</i>

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:54.220
Melts!

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:55.420
<i>What do you think, everyone?</i>

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:56.480
Tsumugi?

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:58.190
Daddy!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:02.200
Write Mommy a letter,
 and tell her to make us some meat!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:07.660
I wonder if Mommy will make us 
meat that's this good?

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:18.550
<i>Yes, this is Megumi.</i>

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.160
This is Inuzuka.
Someone from your restaurant

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.550
gave us your business card yesterday.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:24.410
I'd like to head over now.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:27.010
<i>Now? Today is...</i>

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:27.970
Please!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.130
I want my daughter...

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:32.140
I want my daughter to have a good meal.

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:35.500
<i>All right.</i>

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.610
Thank you!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.490
Where are we going?

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:42.820
Let's have a yummy meal today!

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:44.280
A yummy meal?

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:46.030
Okay!

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.990
<b>Sukippu Road</b>

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:48.990
Daddy, what time is it?

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.630
I've got <i>Magi-Girl</i> recorded.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:55.610
Magi-Magi, Magical Magical!

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:59.150
She'll always be there for you, 
Magi-Girl, Magi-Girl!

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:00.250
The light of...

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:04.080
You sing too, Daddy!

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.150
Okay!

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:09.100
The light of hope, Magi-Girl, Magi-Girl!

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:31.450
Hello.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:34.900
Excuse me, I just called, and...

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.320
It's the girl who's this good!

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:42.330
Are you the girl from before?

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:43.130
Yes.

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:47.970
My mother's out today...

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.600
So we're actually closed.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.560
I see.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:54.900
I'm sorry.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.440
What about the food?

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:01.940
Sorry.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.900
There's no yummy meal?

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:07.140
Let's go somewhere else.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.340
There is one!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.960
There's a yummy meal!

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:15.160
But your mom's not here, right?

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:18.120
I... I can...

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.790
I can make rice!

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:24.710
Pot rice!

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:27.890
It's super-yummy rice!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:31.540
Daddy, she said there's pot rice!

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:32.410
But...

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.850
She says it's super-yummy!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.740
Please sit down.

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:37.720
Okay!

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:42.370
I did say a yummy meal, but...

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:43.800
You, too, Sensei.

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.890
Look, Daddy!

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:49.910
Numbers!

00:15:33.770 --> 00:15:35.370
Excuse me for a moment.

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:41.810
We've never been 
to a place like this, have we?

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:43.630
Yeah.

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:45.810
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:48.330
Poopies?

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:49.490
Nope.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.550
Mom, you dummy!

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:56.100
Why don't pots have memory settings 
for rice cooking?

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.330
I acted all cool and said I could make it!

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:00.520
What's a cup? How much!

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:02.080
Call me when you get this!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.020
Please!

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.290
Did you poopies?

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.510
It went back up.

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:12.700
I'm back.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.410
Um, are you okay?

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.650
With what?

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:17.740
No, just... stuff.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:31.930
What are you doing?

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:34.860
This is how we measured the water 
when we went camping.

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:37.140
I see.

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:42.420
Please give it some time to absorb the water.

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:43.350
Okay!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.310
I'm gonna draw!

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:57.750
You're still not feeling well?

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:00.570
No, just a little worried.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:03.670
It's been so long since we've had food, huh?

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.920
We've had food.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:11.480
Um... it's been forever since 
I've eaten with you, huh?

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:15.930
Maybe, yeah...

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.760
What's that?

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:24.200
It tastes better if you add some sake.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:25.010
I think.

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:27.620
But you can't use alcohol... 
a child's eating it.

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:29.750
Don't worry, Sensei.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:33.660
The alcohol burns away during cooking.

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:38.300
Um...

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.440
That uniform.

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:43.160
Are you from my school?

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:44.660
Yes.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.120
You really didn't remember, did you?

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:50.250
I'm Kotori Iida, from Class 1-A.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.280
You're my assistant teacher, Inuzuka-sensei.

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:54.070
I'm sorry!

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:55.470
No...

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:10.380
Is it done?

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:11.860
Not yet.

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.400
Now I steam it.

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:29.720
Tsumugi! Kouhei-san!

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:31.080
Dinnertime!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.980
You don't need to always 
put so much effort into it.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:37.660
You never eat anything!

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:41.170
I put my soul into every dish.

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:43.130
I want you to enjoy it!

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:13.500
Rice is ready!

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:17.520
Eat up, okay?

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:19.860
I'm so hungry!

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:22.390
Look at how glossy it is!

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:25.980
The rice is standing up and saying hello!

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:27.600
Glossy!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.810
Okay...

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:32.900
Let's eat!

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:40.180
It's good!

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:42.570
You can taste each grain!

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:45.160
Am I amazing, or what?

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.330
It's good!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.150
Daddy! It's good!

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:52.960
Okay...

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:56.030
Watch me eat!

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:01.470
It's super-good!

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:10.970
U-Um...

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:16.440
I'll have some, too.

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:18.650
Try it! 'kay?

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:28.830
It's good!

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:32.250
It's super-good, right?

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.760
It's super-good.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:53.400
Tsumugi.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:55.560
I promise you.

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:57.160
From now on...

00:20:58.040 --> 00:21:01.860
...Daddy will make you good food like this.

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:04.980
Dad will do his best,

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:06.950
so let's eat together, okay?

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.110
Can we?

00:21:08.710 --> 00:21:09.680
Yeah!

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:11.850
Daddy!

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:13.790
Together with Daddy!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.810
Yeah!

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:16.130
Leave it to me!

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:20.170
Um...

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:24.780
Was my rice good?

00:21:24.780 --> 00:21:25.800
Yes.

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:28.050
Thank you.

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:30.710
I'm glad we came.

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:40.140
Then I have a request, Inuzuka-sensei.

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:41.270
A request?

00:21:43.350 --> 00:21:45.650
W-Will you eat dinner with me?

00:21:48.430 --> 00:21:51.410
Sensei, will you eat and make dinner with me?
